"Extra annotations for the tile-region path. Backend hints ride through this "
"dict; the CUDA dialect (``tilelang.cuda.language.atomic_add``) exposes "
"``use_tma`` (sm90+ TMA cp.reduce) as a typed keyword instead."
msgstr ""

